Multi-Modal vs 真实值: 0.4574
Echo-Only vs 真实值: 0.6638  *这是有效值
Saved data_P6 to  ../simulate_data/data_P6/Comparison_MMFE_pred_a_snr-2_lotLostEcho09_echo-only.pth

